   "line": 9,
   "text": "Send the feedback loop one click. Every sample, its echo keeps zero point nine of itself, the pole's radius. Inside the circle, the echo dies out. On the rim, it rings forever. Outside, it blows up. A filter with every pole inside is stable.",
